The plastic imitation of AoY is not of much use, really. Ditch it.

ESP stands for ExtraSensory Perception, and the amulet gives you the
gift of telepathy. Once you put it on, you will sense all 'mind-bearing'
beings around you; very handy.

Training your kitten or dog was discussed here some time ago. The source
implies that you can't train your pet in the strictest meaning of the
word, but you can make it more loyal by feeding it.

When a pet becomes more loyal, it tends to fetch you things more often.
And that's not all: the friendliest of a pet often drops the goodies 'at
your feet', not on the diagonals (remember: shops have doors)!


